    {
      "op": "dm_intro",
      "title": "Wending Mill",
      "subtitle": "Campaign 1: The Lantern Road  -  Level 1  -  6 Emberfall 1047 AK",
      "text": "Two lanterns are dark on the Lantern Road, and somebody is paying goblins for their cores. Last night, in Brindle Cross, a letter came from Captain Rook of Fort Harrow: goblins have been seen near Wending Mill, and she has no one to send. So this morning four people are walking south: Brannoc the soldier, Ilsevel the archivist with her owl Pell, Tamsin the card player, and Oriel the priestess."
    },
