    {
      "op": "narrate",
      "text": "The road south, late morning. Everyone has slept in a bed and eaten Maddy Fenn's porridge, and it shows."
    },
    {
      "op": "camera",
      "to": [
        22,
        6
      ],
      "duration": 0.9
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "A bed, Big Man. An actual bed. I could take on a whole goblin warren today.",
      "speaker": "tamsin",
      "emote": "happy"
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "Don't say that. Milestone six. Four to the mill.",
      "speaker": "brannoc"
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "Do you count everything, Brannoc?",
      "speaker": "oriel"
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "Most things.",
      "speaker": "brannoc"
    },
    {
      "op": "emote",
      "actor": "pell",
      "emote": "exclaim",
      "duration": 1.2,
      "sfx": "alert"
    },
    {
      "op": "narrate",
      "text": "Pell comes back out of the sky hooting hard and lands on Ilsevel's shoulder. She closes her eyes."
    },
    {
      "op": "camera",
      "to": [
        21,
        4
      ],
      "duration": 0.9
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "Goblins. In the hamlet, at the door of the watermill. Four of them, with a log. The people are inside.",
      "speaker": "ilsevel",
      "emote": "alert"
    },
    {
      "op": "narrate",
      "text": "The wind brings it to the rest of them a moment later: shouting, and the slow, heavy thud of wood on wood."
    },
    {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "No time to creep. Run.",
      "speaker": "brannoc"
    },
